        "original_id": "0535ad44-d371-5c36-91f4-a6f6bb131fde",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Felix Salten\n- Works: Bambi, a Life in the Woods; Bambi's Children\n- Places: Vienna; Austria\n- Companies: Ullstein Verlag\n\nFacts:\n- Felix Salten was born on 6 September 1869 and died on 8 October 1945.\n- Felix Salten was an Austrian author and critic in Vienna.\n- Bambi, a Life in the Woods was originally published in Austria in 1923 as Bambi: Eine Lebensgeschichte aus dem Walde.\n- Felix Salten wrote Bambi, a Life in the Woods, and Ullstein Verlag published it.\n- Bambi's Children: The Story of a Forest Family is a novel by Austrian author Felix Salten.\n- Bambi's Children: The Story of a Forest Family is the sequel to Bambi, a Life in the Woods.",
